<title>UK: SBC sets call/put warrants on AEX index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call/put warrants on AEX index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued six million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the AEX index, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one index.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	 ISS PRICE    PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	  750.00 NLG   6.50 NLG     6.66 PCT     11.38 X</p>
<p> CALL B	  775.00 NLG   5.40 NLG     7.90 PCT     13.70 X</p>
<p> CALL C	  800.00 NLG   4.46 NLG     9.29 PCT     16.59 X</p>
<p> PUT D	   700.00 NLG   4.90 NLG     7.90 PCT     15.10 X</p>
<p> PUT E	   725.00 NLG   5.90 NLG     6.57 PCT     12.54 X</p>
<p> PUT F	   750.00 NLG   7.02 NLG     5.34 PCT     10.54 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 18.MAR.97-02.SEP.98   PAYDATE	17.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   =			   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  740.00 NLG</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
